# Firstly run

module load stm32
 
# To run code

Make new dir
Add Makefile
Edit Makefile
    - make sure project, cfiles are correct 

run make to build
make clean to properly remove files

# To test the controller run
st-info --probe

# Then to copy to the controller

st-flash --reset write <programName>.bin 0x8000000

st-flash --reset write ledCube.bin 0x8000000

# To debug

## In 1st terminal
openocd --search /local/java/stm32/openocd/scripts \ -f interface/stlink.cfg -f board/st_nucleo_f3.cfg

Get Port Number 3333

## In 2nd terminal
arm-none-eabi-gdb <programName>.elf
target remote :<portNumber>

To reset from the start
monitor reset halt

To recompile and use debuging close both and restart from above



